WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.440
home insurance and automobile&nbsp;
insurance might be must-haves&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:07.600
but it doesn't have to cost you an arm and&nbsp;
a leg to have the appropriate coverages&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:13.120
there are things you can do to get discounts on&nbsp;
your homeowners insurance and automobile insurance&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:19.360
here are some helpful tips to save money on&nbsp;
your insurance premiums tips on discounts for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:26.560
homeowners insurance security you get discounts if&nbsp;
you have a security system installed in your home&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.600
a gated community tends to have lower&nbsp;
insurance rates and lower rates of crime&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:37.360
something as simple as dead bolt locks might even&nbsp;
give you a discount on your homeowner's insurance&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:44.000
fire safety equipping your home with smoke&nbsp;
detectors and carbon monoxide detectors&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.440
are great steps to lowering your insurance&nbsp;
rates going a step further with fire sprinkler&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:55.200
systems fire escapes fire extinguishers and heat&nbsp;
detectors will help lower your insurance premiums&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:01.920
maintenance making updates to the wiring&nbsp;
of your home having a high rated roof that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:08.000
is hail resistant updating your pipes having hand&nbsp;
rails along staircases or a gate around your pool&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:14.880
are all things that can get you a discount on your&nbsp;
homeowner's insurance no claims in 10 years if&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:19.840
you haven't filed a claim in the last 10 years you&nbsp;
could be eligible for a discount to your insurance&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:24.720
talk with your provider about any other&nbsp;
policy discounts that you might be eligible&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:29.680
for that you may not have thought of in the&nbsp;
past tips on discounts for auto insurance&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:37.040
safe driver if you've had no at fault accidents or&nbsp;
traffic violations then you should be able to get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:44.320
discounts on your car insurance safety features if&nbsp;
your car is equipped with certain safety features&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:48.960
then you could be eligible for discounts&nbsp;
on your insurance ask your agent if they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:53.840
offer discounts for things like airbags&nbsp;
anti-lock brakes and automatic seat belts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.040 --> 00:02:01.280
anti-theft device if your car comes equipped with&nbsp;
an anti-theft device then you get discounts for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:06.560
that you can also install your own alarm&nbsp;
system or a vehicle recovery transceiver&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:13.200
student discounts most insurance companies&nbsp;
will offer discounts for students who maintain&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:18.480
a certain grade level in school since most&nbsp;
insurances will charge young drivers more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:23.440
until they are 25 maintaining a certain&nbsp;
gpa can be a great way to get discounts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:28.880
on your insurance for drivers who are 25&nbsp;
and younger don't let your insurance lapse&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:35.360
if you're thinking about finding a new insurance&nbsp;
provider then do it early don't wait until your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:41.440
insurance lapses aside from the fact that you&nbsp;
can't drive your car if it's uninsured you can be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:45.920
eligible for a discount for maintaining insurance&nbsp;
constantly when you switch to another company&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:50.880
the biggest key to getting the best rates&nbsp;
on your car insurance is shopping around&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:56.560
be sure to ask each insurance company what kind&nbsp;
of discounts they offer to their customers so you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.560 --> 00:03:02.640
can be sure you're getting the best rates and the&nbsp;
most discounts possible that are available to you

